<title>USA: AXENT names John Becker as CEO.</title>
<headline>AXENT names John Becker as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>ROCKVILLE, Md 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>AXENT Technologies Inc said Monday it had named John Becker as chief executive officer and president of the company.</p>
<p>Becker was chief operating officer and president, it said.</p>
<p>Richard Lefebvre, whom Becker is replacing, will remain as chairman of the company's board of directors, it added.</p>
<p>AXENT makes security products for computer and information systems.</p>
